WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Speaker 1>We need a decision on the onboarding email sequence.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Speaker 2>I suggest sending three emails over the first week.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Speaker 1>Agreed, we'll go with three emails.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Speaker 2>I'll draft the email copy by Friday.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.000
<v Speaker 1>What tool should we use to send them?
